<title>FRANCE: Axa shares open lower.</title>
<headline>Axa shares open lower.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French insurer Axa opened 2.21 percent lower on Thursday, quoting for the first time since the company announced it would merge with rival UAP.</p>
<p>At 0907 GMT the share was down 3.14 percent at 308.5 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
